  "gaGeometricProductSeries", "function", 
   "\"The expanded function \
\\!\\(\\*RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[\\\"\[ExponentialE]\\\", \
\\\"#1\\\"]}], \\\"\[GeometricProduct]\\\", RowBox[{RowBox[{\\\"Sin\\\", \
