  "N", "meprec", 
   "\"Internal precision limit $MaxExtraPrecision = \\!\\(\\*RowBox[{\\\"50.`\
\\\"}]\\) reached while evaluating \\!\\(\\*RowBox[{RowBox[{FractionBox[\\\"1\
\\\", \\\"2\\\"], \\\" \\\", RowBox[{\\\"(\\\", \
RowBox[{RowBox[{FractionBox[\\\"1\\\", \\\"2\\\"], \\\" \\\", RowBox[{\\\"Log\
\\\", \\\"[\\\", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{\\\"Plus\\\", \\\"[\\\", \
RowBox[{\\\"\[LeftSkeleton]\\\", \\\"2\\\", \\\"\[RightSkeleton]\\\"}], \\\"]\
\\\"}], \\\"2\\\"], \\\"+\\\", SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{\\\"Plus\\\", \
\\\"[\\\", RowBox[{\\\"\[LeftSkeleton]\\\", \\\"2\\\", \\\"\[RightSkeleton]\\\
\"}], \\\"]\\\"}], \\\"2\\\"]}], \\\"]\\\"}]}], \\\"+\\\", \
